 "requests": {
  "en": "Please take care of a few things on my net banking, queue them all and submit them together at the end.\nOn 19 October I was charged twice by Amazon for \u20b9486 on my savings account. Raise a dispute on the second, duplicate charge.\nI have had stolen my savings account debit card ending 4417. Block it.\nOrder a replacement for that card, delivered to my home address.\nSet the international online limit on my salary account debit card to \u20b925,000 a day.\nOpen a fixed deposit of \u20b9150,000 from my savings account, in the scheme with the highest interest rate for a tenure between 6 and 18 months that allows premature withdrawal, with quarterly interest payout.\nStart a recurring deposit of \u20b95,000 a month from my salary account that matures in the same month as that fixed deposit.\nAdd Papa as the nominee on the new fixed deposit with a 100% share.\nStop the cheque for \u20b922,000 I issued to Meera Iyer; that payment is cancelled.\nSend the confirmations by SMS only and attach the requests to my home branch, Bandra West."
 },
